# My model

Created with `mlship init`. `data/example.csv` is synthetic data so the project runs as is;
replace it, and the model in `train.py`, with yours.

```bash
mlship validate --data data      # every problem at once, without running your code
mlship lock                      # after changing requirements.txt; commit mlship.lock
mlship train --data data         # isolated, reproducible training
mlship runs                      # compare runs
mlship promote 1                 # the version number to serve as champion
mlship serve                     # REST API for the champion
```
